  "description": "Build a powerful house and restore the proud heritage of the vampires! But first, some desserts and shopping! Anne wakes up from her sleep when Eden, the alchemist of time, removes the spear that had put her in a 200-year slumber. The world has changed greatly during that time. Humans have won the war of the races, made great technological advancements, and created a wonderful thing called ice cream. She must now venture through the world of humans with Eden to build a house worthy of her name.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
